msgid ""
"The min / mid / max values are the indicative range a Studio lawyer would "
"use as a starting point in negotiation or judicial reasoning. They reflect "
"the validated legal sources cited below and the inputs you provided. They "
"are not a promise of recovery, a quote, or a verdict."
msgstr ""
"Les valeurs min / mid / max forment la fourchette indicative qu’un avocat du "
"Studio utiliserait comme point de départ en négociation ou raisonnement "
"judiciaire. Elles reflètent les sources validées citées ci-dessous et vos "
"saisies. Elles ne constituent ni une promesse d’indemnisation, ni un devis, "
"ni un jugement."

msgid ""
"The actual amount finally awarded depends on documents, expert reports, the "
"responsibility split, the competent jurisdiction, and the judicial "
"orientation of the deciding court — none of which the platform sees today."
msgstr ""
"Le montant finalement alloué dépend des documents, des expertises, du "
"partage de responsabilité, de la juridiction compétente et de l’orientation "
"judiciaire du tribunal saisi — autant d’éléments que la plateforme ne voit "
"pas aujourd’hui."

